ed}{9}^{2}={{9\\times 9}_{⏟}}_{2\\text{ times}}=81\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186429892 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186138402 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "fc1a0e6d-ed51-5797-8ab7-305e861d1109" :knowledge-point/title "Cubing a Number"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0c0f287a-82ae-555f-a79b-907b97a0e817" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "343" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186429822}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0c0f287a-82ae-555f-a79b-907b97a0e817" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "343" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186429822} :answer-field/id #uuid "f8ce7983-e8cb-5229-8377-65cc977e0ee9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186429889}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "3b68262c-4f64-5130-a6e1-d1cb3e865a03" :question/math-academy-id "q-224035" :question/problem "What is the value of $7$ raised to the power of $3?$\n\n$7$ raised to the power of $3$ is\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "We need to evaluate ${7}^{3}.$\n\nTo evaluate ${7}^{3},$ we start by writing it out with multiplication signs:\n\n$$\n{7}^{3}={{7\\times 7\\times 7}_{⏟}}_{3\\text{ times}}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the product. Since $7\\times 7=49,$ we have\n\n$$\n{{7\\times 7}_{⏟}}_{49}\\times 7=49\\times 7.\n$$\n\nFinally, we work out $49\\times 7.$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned} &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{}_{6}\\,\\,\\,\\, &  \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,4\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,9\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,\\times \\,\\,\\,\\, &  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,7\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,3\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,4\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,3\\,\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned} \\\\  & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $49\\times 7=343,$ we have ${7}^{3}=343.$"}] [{