n$$\n{1}^{7}={{1\\times 1\\times 1\\times 1\\times 1\\times 1\\times 1}_{⏟}}_{7\\text{ times}}=1.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186429904 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186138402 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "fc1a0e6d-ed51-5797-8ab7-305e861d1109" :knowledge-point/title "Cubing a Number"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6792c553-6e2b-568a-a85a-3229229b1c1b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1,000" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186429843}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6792c553-6e2b-568a-a85a-3229229b1c1b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1,000" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186429843} :answer-field/id #uuid "b627d9b0-6f9a-5bc3-8cd4-7fa1d463579b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186429883}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "ca59627a-61c0-5ddb-824a-6032d58fc249" :question/math-academy-id "q-224166" :question/problem "What is the cube of $10?$\n\nThe cube of $10$ is\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "We need to evaluate ${10}^{3}.$\n\nTo evaluate ${10}^{3},$ we start by writing it out with multiplication signs:\n\n$$\n{10}^{3}={{10\\times 10\\times 10}_{⏟}}_{3\\text{ times}}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the product. Since $10\\times 10=100,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{{10\\times 10}_{⏟}}_{100}\\times 10 & =100\\times 10.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since $100\\times 10=1,000,$ we have ${10}^{3}=1,000.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186429906 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186138402 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "fc1a0e6d-ed51-5797-8ab7-305e861d1109" :knowledge-point/title "Cubing a Number"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ec592311-90d1-559e-b5ba-bf63040fd157" :answer/type {:db/id #ed